# Byte-exact artifacts.
#
# The files below are bound by the sha256 of their bytes: the frozen blind
# baseline and its preflight report (harness/blind_baseline.py), the import
# manifest pin inside the preflight (harness/evidence_preflight.py), the ESR
# record and dispositions of the comparison (harness/esr_comparison.py), the
# rubric set's pin on the criterion appendix mapping (harness/appendix_mapping.py),
# the fidelity register's input hashes, and the byte-equal --check of
# tools/import_external_proposal.py and tools/author_msca_dn_workspace.py.
#
# With core.autocrlf=true a fresh checkout rewrites LF to CRLF and every one of
# those bindings fails (decision log msca-dn-line-ending-bindings_2026-10-07).
# `-text` tells git to store and check out these files byte for byte. It does
# not renormalise anything already committed, and diffs still work.
#
# Scope: only trees whose bytes are hashed. Code, prose and the demo instance
# keep the platform default.
#
# Three single files join the trees because records outside those trees bind
# them: the V09 authority source index pins the PE-01 decision and the
# pre-evaluation specification, and the V11 deferral register binds the
# predecessor ticket ledger. The byte-equal --check of
# tools/author_msca_dn_authority_matrix.py and tools/author_deferral_register.py
# is what fails without them.

*.pdf binary
docs/tier2a_instrument_schemas/**/*.rtf -text
docs/tier3_project_instantiation/source_materials/msca_dn/** -text
docs/tier4_orchestration_state/msca_dn/** -text
workspaces/** -text
harness/blind_reports/** -text
harness/*.json -text
harness/profiles/** -text
docs/tier4_orchestration_state/decision_log/msca-dn-*.json -text
plans/msca_dn_pre_evaluation_spec.md -text
plans/pe08_review_and_pe09_handoff_tickets.md -text
